  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">FR-10: rung 3 structural detectors in a NEW `Detectors/` folder (calendar-invite, e-sign completion, invoice #, court/e-filing); per-match provenance; direction symmetry.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Confidence band 0.70–0.95 for rung-3 matches.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Detectors resolve category + invoice/event association + obligations[] (obligations feed W5 FR-19). Emit `RungMatch` + metadata only — no status mapping (task 015).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-024">Invoice/event associations write typed regarding lookups + denormalized fields; no new regarding mechanism.</constraint>
    <constraint source="NFR-04">Detector abstraction MUST be channel-neutral (operates over the envelope) and extensible — adding a detector MUST NOT change the engine.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Component Justification (§11): state the concrete cost-of-doing-nothing for the new `Detectors/` folder in the PR.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Preserve engine contract + task-011 characterization baseline (no regression).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-045">Rung/detector model codified in ADR-045; confirm alignment.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Register the rung + detectors via `CommunicationModule` (ADR-010), unconditional (ADR-032). bff-extensions Placement Justification in the PR; publish-size delta (baseline ~49.63 MB incl. PDBs); no new HIGH CVE.</constraint>
  </constraints>

