      <pattern name="One detector per signal" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/Engine/IAssociationRung.cs">
        `IStructuralDetector.Detect(envelope)` → optional structural match; the rung-3 `IAssociationRung` aggregates all registered detectors. New signal = new detector class, no engine change (NFR-04).
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Obligations feed Responsive Intelligence" location="projects/email-communication-solution-r4/spec.md">
        Detector-resolved obligations[] + category are consumed by W5 (FR-19) EventRules → CreateEvent/Task/Notification.
