  <steps>
    <step order="1">Read the task-011 engine contract + `IAssociationRung`/`RungMatch`; confirm how a rung aggregates multiple sub-results and where category/obligation metadata rides on the match.</step>
    <step order="2">Read the envelope attachment sub-model (task 011) to confirm access to attachment content-type/name for iCal/e-sign/invoice detection.</step>
    <step order="3">Read `.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md` §F + §11 Component Justification + ADR-024 before writing detectors.</step>
    <step order="4">Define `IStructuralDetector` (channel-neutral: `StructuralMatch? Detect(NormalizedMessage)`), the `StructuralMatch` metadata (category, target entity ref, obligations[], confidence, provenance), and the `Detectors/` folder.</step>
    <step order="5">Implement four detectors: CalendarInvite (iCal/`text/calendar` attachment or invite headers → `sprk_event` + event category), ESignCompletion (DocuSign/Adobe "completed" → category + executed-document obligation), InvoiceNumber (invoice-number pattern → invoice target + `invoice` category), CourtEFiling (court/e-filing notice pattern → category + deadline/response obligation). Each in the 0.70–0.95 band with provenance.</step>
    <step order="6">Implement `StructuralDetectorRung` (rung 3): run all registered detectors over the envelope, aggregate `RungMatch` results + category/obligation metadata. Register the rung + detectors in `CommunicationModule` after rung 2.</step>
    <step order="7">Write per-detector unit tests (positive + negative fixtures) + direction-symmetry tests. Coordinate suite scope with task 017.</step>
    <step order="8">Run `dotnet build src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/` + `dotnet test tests/unit/Sprk.Bff.Api.Tests/ --filter Communication`; confirm task-011 characterization tests still pass.</step>
    <step order="8.1">Run `dotnet publish -c Release src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ -o c:/tmp/r4-014-publish/`; report compressed size + delta vs ~49.63 MB baseline. Expected ≈ 0.</step>
    <step order="8.2">Run `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive` — confirm no new HIGH-severity CVEs.</step>
    <step order="9.5">FULL-rigor quality gates: `code-review` on the diff; `adr-check` against `spec.md` (focus FR-10 rung 3 + NFR-04 extensibility + §11 justification + ADR-024). Address Critical findings; cite bff-extensions Placement Justification.</step>
    <step order="10">Run `/conflict-check` before the PR (BFF hot-path; 012/013 are parallel siblings — the new `Detectors/` files are isolated, but confirm `CommunicationModule.cs` edits don't collide).</step>
    <step order="11">Update `tasks/TASK-INDEX.md` (014 ✅) + `current-task.md`; record decisions (detector abstraction shape, detection heuristics, obligation vocabulary).</step>
  </steps>

