  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A new `Detectors/` folder exists with an `IStructuralDetector` abstraction and four detectors (calendar-invite, e-sign completion, invoice #, court/e-filing).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Calendar-invite detector resolves an `sprk_event` association + event category; invoice detector resolves an invoice target + `invoice` category.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">E-sign and court/e-filing detectors resolve category + obligations[] (executed-document / deadline-response) with provenance.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Rung-3 matches land in the 0.70–0.95 confidence band with per-match provenance.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Adding a detector does not require engine changes (NFR-04 extensibility; verified by the aggregation design).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Rung + detectors registered in `CommunicationModule` after rung 2; runs symmetrically inbound + outbound.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No confidence→status mapping here (task 015); `RungMatch` + metadata only; task-011 characterization tests still pass.</criterion>
