  <notes>
    Parallel sibling of 012 (rungs 0/1) and 013 (rung 2). The new `Detectors/` files are isolated; the only shared edit is `CommunicationModule.cs` — coordinate via `/conflict-check`.

    Detector-resolved category + obligations[] are the deterministic feeders for W5 Responsive Intelligence (FR-19); rung 5 (task 031, AI) covers the ambiguous/miss cases the detectors do not catch. Keep the obligation vocabulary aligned with what `EventRulesService` consumes (confirm with W5 scope; obligations are metadata, not yet rule execution).

    Task 015 consumes these `RungMatch` results and maps confidence → status; a high-confidence detector match (≥0.85) is auto-file-eligible under the deterministic ladder.
  </notes>

